        "name": "correctness",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The fix caches one CLI run per page via lru_cache so the suite starts 16 interpreters (12 pages plus the 4 kept CLI contract tests) instead of 172, all 172 tests still pass, broken-rule probes still fail the same tests, no worker count was raised, and the diagnosis rests on interpreter-startup CPU rather than on sharding or workers."
