      {
        "name": "explanation",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The reply reports wall time, user+sys CPU, per-start cost, process counts, before and after over 3 runs each, explains why the suite is CPU-bound and why 8 workers or a 4-job matrix cannot help on a 2-vCPU runner with a ~12s per-job setup cost, and is explicit that the local timing and the ~4s CI estimate are not the real CI step duration."
      },
